<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'Source Han Sans CN, Microsoft YaHei, sans-serif' }}>
  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 12, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />

  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 130, right: 60, fontSize: 330, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EFF8', lineHeight: 1 }}>03</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 200, left: 80, width: 760, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 4, background: '#FFC107' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 5 }}>CHAPTER 03</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 18 }}>第二阶段：选择性 MUAS 与 DMDE</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 22, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 11 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7, flex: 1 }}>
          单周期精细规划建模为多机巢条件下的<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>选择性多无人机协同任务分配</span>问题：是否执行 × 归属 × 顺序 × 终点机巢联合决策
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 11 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7, flex: 1 }}>
          以<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>离散映射差分进化（DMDE）</span>为基础做结构扩展，支持部分分配、顺序搜索与异巢终止
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 16 }}>
      起点机巢由 UAV 当前停靠状态唯一确定（已知状态），终点机巢在可行集合内择优（决策变量）——共同构成「异源起飞—异巢终止」协同；每个任务至多一机执行，部分 UAV 可保持空闲。
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 10, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P10 · 优化模型与适应度</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P11 · 改进 DMDE</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 480, right: 80, width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
    {['统一编码 + 逆映射', '终点机巢最小费用流', '四层准字典序适应度'].map((k) => (
